 <tr><td>6</td><td style=\"padding: 10px;\">Disaster</td><td style=\"padding: 10px;\">possibly</td><td style=\"padding: 10px;\">impossibly</td></tr>\n</table>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 35568494, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 35570635, "text": "<h2>Example sentence:</h2>\n<span style=\"font-style: italic\">Rolled 2 and 6</span>\n<br>\nThe <span style=\"color:#E8492A\">carrot</span> was <span style=\"color:#E8492A\">possibly</span> the biggest he had ever seen!\n<br><br>\n<h2>Example challenge sentence:</h2>\n<span style=\"font-style: italic\">Rolled 1, 2 and 5</span>\n<br>\nThey would <span style=\"color:#E8492A\">surely </span> need to sail faster than the <span style=\"color:#E8492A\">pirate ship</span>, for if they did not, their little boat would <span style=\"color:#E8492A\">certainly </span> be overpowered by the pirates, and all the crew taken captive.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 35568494, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState"